Yes.  But you have the tools to avoid needing to retreat.

-- You have a wand of lightning.  Only @, A, minotaurs, and Riders are
meaningful threats to you in melee.  A purple L at the castle is both
rare and meaningless at the same time.  (You may even have a potion of
hallucination available, which fails against the troll but _does_ work
for a purple L.)

-- You are an XL13 Barbarian with Cleaver.  You can melee minotaurs and
captains and win, because you have a gazillion HP and a big weapon that
will hit every time.

-- You have the wand of digging needed to escape the Titan Medusa.  If
you accidentally dig to the Castle (unlikely if you're careful) and 
land in the maze, see the previous two points; neither a purple L nor 
a minotaur is a big deal.

There aren't any other threats.  The Castle is dealt with via banging
the drawbridge; this will give you MR and reflection, which renders the
wand of death meaningless.  And more importantly, the Castle is
somewhere you were going _anyway_.

The elaborate "kill the troll" method is the hard way. Really. :)

